    <Folder>
      <name>Intelligence Summary</name>
      <Placemark>
        <name>AI Council Assessment</name>
        <styleUrl>#intel</styleUrl>
        <description>The Department of War continues to expand its technological capabilities and military partnerships. The USS Abraham Lincoln (CVN-72) has arrived in Thailand, marking a significant deployment. The DPAA has hosted first-ever Lao POW/MIA talks in Crystal City, Virginia, and the DCMA celebrated teams with over 250 years of functional excellence. Additionally, the Department of War conducted meetings with military leaders from various countries, including Peru, Fiji, Tonga, Australia, New Zealand, the Philippines, India, and New Zealand.</description>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>0,0,0</coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
    </Folder>
